#: ../../source/docs/modules/checklist.rst:11 62ee8ce9ddfb4e6c8f95792468619718
msgid ""
"A \"checklist.txt\" file is required in the ``--aircraft`` folder, where the"
" checklist items will be displayed from. Otherwise a generic checklist will "
"be shown."
msgstr ""
"需要在 ``--aircraft`` 文件夹中提供 「checklist.txt」 文件，检查清单条目将从该文件中读取。否则将显示通用检查清单。"
